{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Master of Mosquiton","In the 1920's, Inaho resurrects a vampire named Mosquiton with her blood. He awakens and becomes her slave. Now, Inaho is after the O-Part, which will grant her immortality. However, a bunch of supernatural monsters are out to stop them from achieving their goal.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["マスターモスキートン",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-1805","ids":{"shikimori":1805,"mal":1805,"anilist":1805,"kodik":"serial-24571"},"kodikIds":["serial-20553","serial-24571"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-20553":"2020-01-01T20:12:50Z","serial-24571":"2020-04-08T10:55:31Z"},"title":"Хозяйка Москитона","originalTitle":"Master Mosquiton","alt":"Господин Москитон OVA / Master of Mosquiton Master of Mosquiton マスターモスキートン","description":"В 1920 году Инахо Хитомэборэ с помощью своей крови воскрешает вампира по имени Москитон , после чего он становится её слугой. Теперь она хочет найти таинственный оберег, что позволит ей стать бессмертной. Однако на пути к её цели стоит огромное количество сверхъестественных существ, которые тоже не прочь завладеть этим оберегом.","year":1996,"type":"OVA","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","Комедия","Сверхъестественное","мифология","вампиры"],"rating":6.7,"popularity":2107,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1805/9379e9baab37c5a42ce68b1e87539a71.jpeg","width":225,"height":325},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/4f98a360cfd17f66f79f53ad32b9b3022d2741d1.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-20553","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/ser